# Paths that self-development (autodev) may not change without the owner.
# One glob per line, matched case-insensitively against repository paths with
# gitignore-style semantics: `**` spans any number of directories, and a leading
# `**/` also matches at the repository root, so `**/CLAUDE.md` covers `CLAUDE.md`.
# Read from the pinned main commit by the autodev broker (docs/autodev-plan.md, section 5.3).
# A change counts if either side of it matches: renames and deletions included.
# The owner's `autodev:next` label opens these paths, except the control paths listed
# in .github/autodev-control-paths, which no label opens.
